mw2coop patch for maps/_load.gsc (Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)

1. Start the co-op campaign framework (it does nothing outside a co-op campaign session).
@@@ replace
	if ( is_coop() )
		maps\_coop::main();
@@@ with
	if ( is_coop() )
		maps\_coop::main();

	maps\_mw2coop::main();
@@@ end

2. A trigger that sends a group of enemies to hunt "the player" sends each to the closest player
   still up (maps\_mw2coop::seek_player; player 1 outside co-op).
@@@ replace
			ai[ i ] SetGoalEntity( level.player );
@@@ with
			ai[ i ] SetGoalEntity( maps\_mw2coop::seek_player( ai[ i ].origin ) );
@@@ end

2. Checkpoints: handle_starts() runs each start point's section function (add_start's fourth
   argument) in order, each until its section is done; entering one means the players reached
   that start point. maps\_mw2coop::section_reached makes it the co-op checkpoint (the level
   restarts there when the mission fails). Levels that run their sections themselves call it
   from their own patches.
@@@ subst handle_starts
		[[ start_array[ "logic_func" ] ]]();
@@@ to
		maps\_mw2coop::section_reached( start_array[ "name" ] );
		[[ start_array[ "logic_func" ] ]]();
@@@ end
